    "number": 923,
    "title": "Verify heap slots and free-slot list",
    "body": "Enable `mm::heap::slot` and `slot_list` in place and verify ten existing functions. Prove empty construction, LIFO push/pop, exclusive slot ownership transfer, preservation of remaining links, and exact slot address/type/size and physical-address conversion.\n\nKeep the `usize` link representation, using existing vstd permission-aware reads/writes and provenance helpers to verify memory access. Runtime behavior is preserved. Slab allocation, large alloc/dealloc, and the global allocator remain disabled.\n\nOverlaps #505 in scope; implemented independently from main without its external raw-pointer read/write specifications.",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Enable <code class=\"notranslate\">mm::heap::slot</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">slot_list</code> in place and verify ten existing functions. Prove empty construction, LIFO push/pop, exclusive slot ownership transfer, preservation of remaining links, and exact slot address/type/size and physical-address conversion.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Keep the <code class=\"notranslate\">usize</code> link representation, using existing vstd permission-aware reads/writes and provenance helpers to verify memory access. Runtime behavior is preserved. Slab allocation, large alloc/dealloc, and the global allocator remain disabled.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Overlaps <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4595411674\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/asterinas/vostd/issues/505\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/asterinas/vostd/pull/505/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/asterinas/vostd/pull/505\">#505</a> in scope; implemented independently from main without its external raw-pointer read/write specifications.</p>",
