      "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Could you please review the two #[verifier::external] annotations on the existing Send/<code class=\"notranslate\">Sync</code> impls? Verus rejects these unsafe impls within the verified code, and this PR does not prove their thread safety. Is retaining them as a trusted boundary acceptable, or should their safety be established in this PR? Is there a preferred way to handle such cases?</p>",
